"Binary default is off. The install manifest passes it. When it is on, the"
" ModelAdapter controller uses the runtime API if the ``aibrix-runtime`` "
"container is present, and the engine API otherwise. ModelClaim always "
"uses the runtime."
msgstr ""
"二进制默认关闭。安装清单会传入它。开启后，若存在 ``aibrix-runtime`` 容器，ModelAdapter 控制器使用 runtime"
" API，否则使用引擎 API。ModelClaim 始终使用 runtime。"

